# What must never enter the Docker build context (AD-4, AD-21).
#
# The build context is uploaded wholesale to the Docker daemon — and in CI it is the checked-out
# repo. Two of the rules below are security rules, not size rules:
#
#   * `.env` holds the Atlassian API token and the Anthropic key. It must never reach a build
#     context, an image layer, or a registry. Credentials arrive at runtime via --env-file (AD-4).
#   * `config/registry.yaml` is one tenant's real account/folder ids. Excluding it keeps the image
#     **generic** — the same artifact serves every tenant, and the real config is mounted read-only
#     at run time (`-v /opt/agent/config:/app/config:ro`). Baking a tenant into the image would make
#     a pushed image tenant-specific and publish those ids to whoever can pull it.
#
# The Dockerfile only COPYs `pyproject.toml`, `README.md`, `app/`, and `config/`, so most of the rest
# is a build-speed concern — but an excluded file cannot be copied by a future edit either.

# --- secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- one tenant's config: mounted at runtime, never baked in ----------------------------------
config/registry.yaml

# --- runtime state: the live SQLite store and the .md exports (AD-2, FR-15) -------------------
data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# --- python ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# --- not needed at runtime ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: `scripts/` is deliberately NOT ignored — the Agent B image (deploy/Dockerfile.agent_b) runs
# `scripts/run_agent_b_*.py` as its entrypoints. Agent A's Dockerfile simply never COPYs it, so
# including it in the context costs nothing there.
.git/
.github/
tests/
fixtures/
planning-artifacts/
implementation-state/
*.md
!README.md

# --- os ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
